<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 15:38:16 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>婴儿潮一代与 X 世代参议员之争成为检验美国政治代际变化以及国会年龄上限的关键考验</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/baby-boomer-vs-gen-x-senate-race-massachusetts-markey-moulton-generational-change-us-politics/</link><description>参议员埃德·马基 (Ed Markey) 80 岁，而他的竞争对手众议员塞思·莫尔顿 (Seth Moulton) 47 岁。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26241523289937-e1788101511603.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 15:05:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/baby-boomer-vs-gen-x-senate-race-massachusetts-markey-moulton-generational-change-us-politics/</guid></item><item><title>奥利维亚·罗德里戈 (Olivia Rodrigo) 和慈善家梅琳达·法兰西·盖茨 (Melinda French Gates) 举办慈善演出，回顾 90 年代女权主义运动，为女性福祉筹集 2000 万美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/olivia-rodrigo-philanthropy-melinda-french-gates-womens-well-being-dasiy-chain-fields/</link><description>梅琳达·法兰西·盖茨 (Melinda French Gates) 在罗德里戈演出开始时出人意料地亮相，并承诺通过她的 Pivotal Ventures 提供 1000 万美元，并称赞她“向新一代展示了他们的声音有多么重要”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2292659601-e1788100577933.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 14:48:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/olivia-rodrigo-philanthropy-melinda-french-gates-womens-well-being-dasiy-chain-fields/</guid></item><item><title>伊朗战争六个月后，全球经济呈现出“不可能完成的任务”场景，特朗普家族是赢家之一</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/iran-war-global-economy-mission-impossible-oil-prices-trump-family-defense-contracts-investments-stocks/</link><description>即使世界经济的每个角落都受到影响，最可怕的预测也不会成为现实。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26239535624078-e1788099853500.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 14:31:37 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/iran-war-global-economy-mission-impossible-oil-prices-trump-family-defense-contracts-investments-stocks/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普在谈论格陵兰岛计划时多次犯错，但冰岛选民拒绝重启加入欧盟谈判的提议</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/voters-iceland-referendum-talks-european-union-membership-trump-greenland/</link><description>反对者以 52.8% 比 47.2% 的优势击败了这项措施。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2291740162-e1788099148653.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 14:19:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/voters-iceland-referendum-talks-european-union-membership-trump-greenland/</guid></item><item><title>美国纳税人在体育场馆上花费了 330 亿美元。他们的座位更少，价格更高</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/american-taxpayers-spend-33billion-taxes-sports-stadiums-higher-tickets/</link><description>“从来没有人建造过新体育场并降低门票价格。没有人尝试这么做。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GettyImages-2277113728-e1781123626146.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 13:26:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/american-taxpayers-spend-33billion-taxes-sports-stadiums-higher-tickets/</guid></item><item><title>Gen Zer 洗了大学篮球队的脏衣服，拖了地板，以证明他的热情——现在他是 NBA 有史以来最年轻的实习生之一</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/gen-zer-washed-his-college-basketball-teams-dirty-clothes-and-mopped-floors-to-prove-his-passion-now-hes-one-of-the-youngest-interns-ever-at-the-nba/</link><description>年仅 19 岁的丹尼尔·宋 (Daniel Sung) 被嘲笑为“拖把男孩”，他将大学一年的篮球苦差事变成了梦想中的 NBA 实习机会、在 LinkedIn 上的名气以及多个初创公司的录用机会。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/college_basketball_NBA_intern.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 13:22:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/gen-zer-washed-his-college-basketball-teams-dirty-clothes-and-mopped-floors-to-prove-his-passion-now-hes-one-of-the-youngest-interns-ever-at-the-nba/</guid></item><item><title>顶级经济学家表示，现在是市场的“恐慌季节”，放暑假都是你的错。归咎于“收获季节”心态</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/panic-season-epic-financial-disaster-owen-lamont-stocks/</link><description>规模达 1,950 亿美元的 Acadian 基金的高级副总裁欧文·拉蒙特 (Owen Lamont) 表示，你需要为一场“史诗般的金融灾难”做好心理准备——就像每年的八月和九月一样。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/GettyImages-2227285458-e1754083983281.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 13:20:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/panic-season-epic-financial-disaster-owen-lamont-stocks/</guid></item><item><title>价值 100 亿美元的珀杜农场和价值 120 亿美元的喜来登酒店帝国的女继承人仍然穿着旧衣服，仍然乘坐地铁，乘坐经济舱</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/perdue-farms-sheraton-hotels-heiress-wore-hand-me-downs-rides-subway-flies-economy/</link><description>“如果你总是乘坐私人飞机，你对现实世界有什么了解？” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/GettyImages-1398388535.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 13:16:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/perdue-farms-sheraton-hotels-heiress-wore-hand-me-downs-rides-subway-flies-economy/</guid></item><item><title>韩国可能已经太老了，无法利用人工智能的繁荣</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/south-korea-may-be-getting-too-old-for-ai-boom-goldman-sachs/</link><description>韩国可能会因人工智能而变得更加富裕，而老年家庭则不愿意或无法花费这些收益&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2291478455-e1787934655804.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/south-korea-may-be-getting-too-old-for-ai-boom-goldman-sachs/</guid></item><item><title>女子职业足球面临香槟问题：世界杯期间排得满满的日程将考验其巨大增长的可持续性</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/womens-professional-soccer-nwsl-2027-calendar-fifa-world-cup/</link><description>“这个赛程表是有意设计的，目的是将 NWSL 置于女子足球历史上最重要的年份之一的中心，”委员杰西卡·伯曼说。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2290427599-e1787931964548.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 10:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/womens-professional-soccer-nwsl-2027-calendar-fifa-world-cup/</guid></item></channel></rss>